# Line endings are normalised to LF in the working tree, not just in the index.
#
# This is load-bearing rather than cosmetic. Attestations pin a digest over the
# contents of the files they reviewed, and the fidelity check compares quoted
# blocks against the source specification. If a checkout on Windows produced
# CRLF and one on Linux produced LF, the same commit would yield two different
# digests and every attestation would read as stale on one of the platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
